@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Designer / BIM user" as User
actor "Deputy director\n(customer)" as Customer
actor "BIM coordinator\n(domain expert)" as Expert
rectangle "ContextFilter" as CF
rectangle "Autodesk Revit" as Revit

Customer --> CF : business need\nacceptance
Expert --> CF : domain workflow\nvalidation
User --> CF : filter intent\naction
CF --> User : matched set\nfeedback
CF --> Revit : selection / visibility\ncompatible native filter
Revit --> CF : document / view / selection\nelements / parameters

note bottom of CF
Find the right Revit elements
inside the current working context
and act on the matched set.
end note
@enduml
